548
00:44:21,620 --> 00:44:22,840
Sujeto pasivo.

549
00:44:22,840 --> 00:44:26,820
La persona cuyo patrimonio resulta
afectado.

550
00:44:32,350 --> 00:44:33,950
Elementos del tipo penal.

551
00:44:34,130 --> 00:44:39,770
Los elementos del tipo penal permiten
determinar si una conducta reúne las

552
00:44:39,770 --> 00:44:42,470
